gregguns.icbm.effect.condensed=A plain high-explosive blast that digs a crater.
gregguns.icbm.effect.shrapnel=Fragments set everything in the blast zone on fire for 5 seconds.
gregguns.icbm.effect.anvil=Heavy fragments leave everything in the blast zone with Slowness III for 10 seconds.
gregguns.icbm.effect.incendiary=Sets the ground and everything in the blast zone on fire. No crater.
gregguns.icbm.effect.debilitation=A 30-second gas cloud that gives Slowness II, Weakness II and nausea.
gregguns.icbm.effect.chemical=A 30-second cloud of Poison II.
gregguns.icbm.effect.smoke=A harmless 30-second marker cloud.
gregguns.icbm.effect.repulsive=Throws everything in the blast zone outward. No crater.
gregguns.icbm.effect.attractive=Pulls everything in the blast zone toward the center. No crater.
gregguns.icbm.effect.fragmentation=A large crater that sets everything in the blast zone on fire for 5 seconds.
gregguns.icbm.effect.contagious=A 30-second cloud of Poison IV and Hunger II.
gregguns.icbm.effect.sonic=Shatters every glass block in the blast zone and leaves everything in it with nausea and Slowness III. No crater.
gregguns.icbm.effect.breaching=Bores a 3 by 3 tunnel straight down, 24 blocks deep, through anything of hardness 50 or less. No crater.
gregguns.icbm.effect.thermobaric=The widest conventional crater of any warhead.
gregguns.icbm.effect.exothermic=A wide crater, and everything inside it burns for 5 seconds.
gregguns.icbm.effect.endothermic=A wide crater, and everything inside it is slowed to a crawl for 10 seconds.
gregguns.icbm.effect.emp=Releases one EMP pulse: drains the nearest devices in the radius, gives multiblocks a maintenance issue, and knocks down or sets off missiles in flight. No crater.
gregguns.icbm.effect.antimatter=The widest crater of any warhead. Everything living inside the kill zone dies, bosses included, and any Red Matter within 200 blocks is destroyed. It leaves no fallout.
gregguns.icbm.effect.redmatter=No crater at first: a black ball of annihilation grows from the blast, eats the blocks around it, pulls in what is near and kills everything it touches, bosses included. It idles once it is full size and ends within a minute. It leaves no fallout.
gregguns.icbm.effect.nuclear=Everything living inside the kill zone dies, bosses included. The surface around it is left irradiated.

